OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANI secretary of state calls for
OL,4,A'compromise' as Orange Order march
OL,5,Ablocked by protesters
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland First Minister
OL,8,FMichelle O'Neill, who is among the
OL,9,Fdemonstrators, says the decision to
OL,10,Fallow the march to go ahead "brings
OL,11,Finto question how the peace process
OL,12,Fworks"
OL,14,FDUP leader Gavin Robinson has
OL,15,Fcriticised her party's participation in
OL,16,Fthe protest, telling a news conference
OL,17,Fthat O'Neill and other Sinn Fein
OL,18,Fpoliticians in attendance are
OL,19,F"lawmakers acting as lawbreakers"
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
